Solution:

1. Open the challenge page and inspect the page source code.
2. Look for suspicious JavaScript code inside the <script> tags.
3. Notice that the JavaScript strings are encoded using hexadecimal escape sequences such as \x76, \x61, etc.
4. Decode the JavaScript to reveal the actual strings and logic.
5. Analyze the decoded code and identify that the check() function retrieves the values of the user and pass input fields.
6. Observe that the code compares both input values against Cyber-Talent.
7. Enter Cyber-Talent as the username.
8. Enter Cyber-Talent as the password.
9. Submit the credentials.
10. A congratulatory popup containing the flag is displayed.
